## 🎯 Project Objectives

* 🩸 Make blood donor discovery easier
* ⚡ Reduce the time required to find donors
* 📱 Provide an accessible digital platform
* 🤝 Encourage voluntary blood donation
* 🌐 Centralize donor information
* 🚨 Support faster emergency response

